                <head>No. 755<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>In telegram 2468 from Tokyo, April 10, Ambassador Allison commented on the impact of the Geneva Conference on
                    Japan. For text of this telegram, see <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v16/pg_510"
                        >volume XVI, page 510</ref>.</p>
